    "Rectangle/obround requires positive width and height and optional round hole; legacy rectangular holes are unsupported." : {
      "comment" : "A rectangle or obround (rounded-end rectangle) aperture in a Gerber file has a zero or negative side, or uses the old-style rectangular center hole the app does not implement.",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reghoek/obrond vereis positiewe breedte en hoogte en opsionele ronde gat; ouer reghoekige gate word nie ondersteun nie."
